WEBVTT

00:01:35.760 --> 00:01:37.450
Just when I left town
for a little while...

00:01:37.790 --> 00:01:41.780
...the Monsters brazenly attacked
Seyruun's royal palace!

00:01:41.860 --> 00:01:44.920
Considering the danger, running away
might have been an acceptable option...

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:47.930
...but Gourry and the others were
trapped inside a weird space barrier...

00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:50.490
...and I was still pretty much helpless!

00:01:50.570 --> 00:01:54.010
I had to try a dangerous spell
that I could barely control.

00:02:09.090 --> 00:02:10.580
We'll take him,
if you don't mind.

00:02:10.660 --> 00:02:15.030
If you wish to have him back,
then be prepared not to flee from us!

00:02:18.030 --> 00:02:19.660
Stop!

00:02:24.940 --> 00:02:26.030
Daddy!

00:02:32.750 --> 00:02:34.650
They disappeared...

00:02:34.710 --> 00:02:36.910
My uncle...

00:02:37.580 --> 00:02:40.920
Brother...
Just what's going on here?!

00:02:45.520 --> 00:02:47.490
Gourry!

00:02:48.360 --> 00:02:50.420
I... I'm okay...

00:02:50.500 --> 00:02:52.590
No, you're NOT okay!

00:02:52.670 --> 00:02:54.830
Come on...

00:02:55.030 --> 00:02:57.470
First of all, we have
to get your wounds treated!

00:03:07.050 --> 00:03:10.610
Even with my powers the way they
are now, I can still do this.

00:03:10.680 --> 00:03:12.710
Thanks.

00:03:16.490 --> 00:03:19.080
Lina, was what
you said before true?

00:03:20.060 --> 00:03:22.390
About them being after me?

00:03:22.460 --> 00:03:23.430
Yeah.

00:03:23.500 --> 00:03:25.520
I think it's definite now.

00:03:25.600 --> 00:03:28.360
Despite what Kanzel may say,
when you consider that...

00:03:28.430 --> 00:03:30.990
...he sent a Monster
to kill me, well...

00:03:31.070 --> 00:03:34.630
You have caused a lot of trouble
for the Monsters in the past, you know.

00:03:34.710 --> 00:03:37.730
True, but I don't think
they're after me just for that.

00:03:37.810 --> 00:03:39.970
What do you mean?

00:03:40.050 --> 00:03:42.380
I'm not really sure myself...

00:03:42.450 --> 00:03:45.910
...but Kanzel and the others
definitely have an agenda.

00:03:45.990 --> 00:03:48.580
And, somehow, I'm a threat to it.

00:03:48.650 --> 00:03:52.280
Hm... Either way,
we still have to fight them.

00:03:52.530 --> 00:03:54.720
And next time we have
to take the initiative!

00:03:54.790 --> 00:03:57.730
We do have Lina's
new spell now, though.

00:03:57.800 --> 00:04:00.130
If you're talking about
the Ragna Blade, forget it.

00:04:01.700 --> 00:04:03.960
I knew enough to try it out...

00:04:04.700 --> 00:04:07.730
The spell which creates
the dark sword powered by...

00:04:07.810 --> 00:04:10.280
...the golden Dark Lord,
the Lord of Nightmares.

00:04:10.340 --> 00:04:12.740
The Ragna Blade.

00:04:13.710 --> 00:04:16.910
But that thing takes too
much magical power to produce.

00:04:16.980 --> 00:04:21.150
In my condition, I could only
summon it for a second or two.

00:04:21.690 --> 00:04:24.620
That worked fine against a
stationary target like that barrier...

00:04:24.690 --> 00:04:27.220
...but it'd be useless against
an opponent who could move.

00:04:27.990 --> 00:04:29.760
Oh, I see...

00:04:29.830 --> 00:04:32.860
It'll be a different story
once I get my powers back, but...

00:04:32.930 --> 00:04:36.770
I see. So, your powers still
aren't completely back yet.

00:04:36.840 --> 00:04:39.770
Well, if they're not back,
they're not back.

00:04:39.840 --> 00:04:43.400
We'll have to think of a plan to
beat them using what I CAN do.

00:04:44.210 --> 00:04:45.440
It looks that way.

00:04:45.510 --> 00:04:46.670
Yeah.

00:04:46.750 --> 00:04:49.310
Miss Lina! Trouble!

00:04:49.550 --> 00:04:52.480
What's up? Did you check
out what Christopher's up to?

00:04:52.550 --> 00:04:54.310
There's no time for that!

00:04:54.390 --> 00:04:57.360
Uncle Christopher has renounced
his claim to the throne!

00:04:57.760 --> 00:04:59.350
He what?!

00:04:59.430 --> 00:05:02.360
You mean, even if
something happens to Phil...

00:05:02.430 --> 00:05:04.290
...he still wouldn't
become the ruler?

00:05:04.360 --> 00:05:06.730
Exactly! He says he's
taking responsibility...

00:05:06.800 --> 00:05:09.100
...for being tricked
by those sorcerers!

00:05:09.770 --> 00:05:11.400
What can this mean?

00:05:11.470 --> 00:05:15.030
That Christopher really isn't
behind this conspiracy?

00:05:15.910 --> 00:05:18.710
Something else is going on.

00:05:19.610 --> 00:05:21.240
Am I being clear?!

00:05:21.310 --> 00:05:24.540
Investigate any place
that seems suspicious!

00:05:24.980 --> 00:05:28.280
We have to find Kanzel and my
brother's whereabouts at any cost!

00:05:28.350 --> 00:05:29.080
Now go!

00:05:29.150 --> 00:05:30.120
Yes, sir!

00:05:30.190 --> 00:05:32.160
Wow, you were right.

00:05:32.220 --> 00:05:35.160
Right after he renounced
his claim to the throne...

00:05:35.230 --> 00:05:38.460
...he formed a search party
like he really meant it!

00:05:38.530 --> 00:05:42.130
But isn't Christopher the
most likely suspect here?

00:05:42.200 --> 00:05:45.640
Yeah, since he's next
in line for the throne...

00:05:45.700 --> 00:05:48.800
...if anything
happened to Prince Phil.

00:05:48.870 --> 00:05:54.740
Besides, Alfred said that Uncle
Christopher was behind all this.

00:05:55.150 --> 00:05:59.140
We can't be sure Christopher's
doing any of this sincerely...

00:06:00.120 --> 00:06:04.060
Anyway, it looks like we
need to talk to Alfred again.

00:06:07.090 --> 00:06:09.390
He's gone?! Alfred?

00:06:09.460 --> 00:06:12.060
Yeah! I checked his
mansion, naturally...

00:06:12.130 --> 00:06:14.930
...and he isn't anywhere on
the palace grounds, either!

00:06:15.900 --> 00:06:18.170
Then where?

00:06:18.240 --> 00:06:22.640
He has another house just outside
the city. We could check there.

00:06:47.130 --> 00:06:50.070
Hello-o-o! Alfred!

00:06:50.740 --> 00:06:52.760
Alfred!

00:06:56.240 --> 00:06:58.730
There's no answer.

00:06:59.140 --> 00:07:00.870
Let's go.

00:07:14.630 --> 00:07:16.650
Alfred?

00:07:24.740 --> 00:07:26.900
Alfred?

00:07:27.770 --> 00:07:31.330
Welcome, all of you.
I thought you'd come here.

00:07:32.280 --> 00:07:37.010
Meaning you've heard that Christopher's
renounced his claim to the throne.

00:07:37.550 --> 00:07:39.570
Yes, I heard about that.

00:07:39.650 --> 00:07:42.450
So what's going on?
According to what you told us...

00:07:43.020 --> 00:07:46.250
My father is definitely
the main plotter!

00:07:47.060 --> 00:07:50.460
That's why I want one more
chance to talk Father out of this!

00:07:50.530 --> 00:07:53.990
So I want you to wait
until I've done that!

00:07:54.070 --> 00:07:58.900
If Christopher was
really behind all of this...

00:07:59.410 --> 00:08:01.930
...he wouldn't
have done what he did.

00:08:02.010 --> 00:08:05.840
Exactly. Father can
really frustrate me at times.

00:08:06.010 --> 00:08:10.310
Here I was, practically handing
him the rule of this kingdom...

00:08:11.120 --> 00:08:15.050
...and he refuses it with no thought
of his son's feelings in the matter.

00:08:15.120 --> 00:08:16.820
What did you say?!

00:08:16.890 --> 00:08:22.660
I probably would have gotten away
with it, if you all hadn't shown up.

00:08:26.100 --> 00:08:30.090
In other words, you
came up with this plot...

00:08:30.170 --> 00:08:32.030
...so YOU could
become ruler of Seyruun.

00:08:32.810 --> 00:08:35.240
That's exactly correct.

00:08:35.670 --> 00:08:38.640
You... How can you
be so blase about this?!

00:08:38.710 --> 00:08:43.510
I thought something was fishy,
but you still tricked us.

00:08:43.750 --> 00:08:46.720
That little attack on
yourself you staged helped.

00:08:48.920 --> 00:08:50.080
That and this as well...

00:08:50.160 --> 00:08:53.090
All was done so that
I could become the ruler.

00:08:53.160 --> 00:08:55.960
I deserve to rule Seyruun!

00:08:56.160 --> 00:09:00.260
Once I'm in charge, Seyruun will
become an even more powerful kingdom!

00:09:00.330 --> 00:09:03.630
And then I will
rule the entire world!

00:09:04.240 --> 00:09:08.200
Wanting to take over the world for your
own ambitions! That's unforgivable!

00:09:09.170 --> 00:09:12.340
What else does
the world exist for?

00:09:12.610 --> 00:09:16.070
I suppose you fools
just don't understand that.

00:09:16.150 --> 00:09:17.910
You've gotta be kidding!

00:09:17.980 --> 00:09:20.750
However, thanks
to your coming to Seyruun...

00:09:20.820 --> 00:09:23.580
...my plans have been
completely disrupted.

00:09:23.660 --> 00:09:26.680
I didn't manage
to kill Uncle Phil.

00:09:28.030 --> 00:09:29.760
Where is my father?!

00:09:29.830 --> 00:09:33.290
Yes, about that...
I'd like to know as well.

00:09:33.370 --> 00:09:35.200
What do you mean?

00:09:35.270 --> 00:09:37.290
Kanzel!

00:09:41.840 --> 00:09:42.970
You called?

00:09:43.040 --> 00:09:44.370
Just what were you thinking?

00:09:44.440 --> 00:09:47.840
I ordered you to
kill Philionel, didn't I?

00:09:47.910 --> 00:09:52.980
Yes, you did indeed
order me to kill that man.

00:09:53.050 --> 00:09:55.610
However, we have our own purpose.

00:09:55.690 --> 00:09:57.350
Your own purpose?!

00:09:57.420 --> 00:09:58.550
Yes...

00:09:58.620 --> 00:10:01.560
I couldn't care less
what your purposes are!

00:10:01.630 --> 00:10:06.790
I want these people and Philionel
dead! They stand in my way!

00:10:07.330 --> 00:10:08.460
You're sure about that?

00:10:08.530 --> 00:10:12.700
Of course! Absolute obedience!
That's what our contract said!

00:10:13.410 --> 00:10:16.600
Yes, it did.
Then I have no choice.

00:10:24.120 --> 00:10:26.520
Wha... What?

00:10:27.790 --> 00:10:29.810
Alfred!

00:10:35.430 --> 00:10:39.120
lmpossible...
You can't break your contract!

00:10:40.930 --> 00:10:43.030
You seem to be mistaken.

00:10:43.100 --> 00:10:46.070
The contract you made
was with Kanzel, not me.

00:11:06.150 --> 00:11:08.640
You... You've betrayed me...

00:11:09.890 --> 00:11:11.580
Betrayed you?

00:11:11.660 --> 00:11:14.650
This was our plan
from the beginning.

00:11:15.430 --> 00:11:19.630
Did you really think we Monsters
would swear allegiance to you?

00:11:19.930 --> 00:11:21.800
Wha... What?

00:11:22.570 --> 00:11:26.700
In the end, all you did
was play into our hands.

00:11:35.350 --> 00:11:36.470
Alfred!

00:11:36.550 --> 00:11:39.350
You... You're despicable!

00:11:44.090 --> 00:11:45.820
Just what are you up to?!

00:11:45.890 --> 00:11:49.830
Wasn't your plan to rule
Seyruun from behind the scenes?!

00:11:50.730 --> 00:11:53.860
True, our original plan
was to put him on the throne...

00:11:53.930 --> 00:11:56.420
...and then secretly
control Seyruun.

00:11:56.500 --> 00:12:02.630
However, Lina Inverse, that was
only until you showed up here!

00:12:06.810 --> 00:12:07.800
What?

00:12:07.880 --> 00:12:10.180
What is it?!

00:12:15.390 --> 00:12:17.010
An... An earthquake!

00:12:17.090 --> 00:12:19.610
Are they doing it?!

00:12:26.800 --> 00:12:28.360
What have you done?!

00:13:05.400 --> 00:13:07.930
That's Alfred's!

00:13:08.810 --> 00:13:11.110
What's that?!

00:13:26.530 --> 00:13:29.550
This is the simplest way
to keep you from running.

00:13:29.630 --> 00:13:30.930
What?!

00:13:31.000 --> 00:13:34.760
The only way you're leaving
here is when you're dead...

00:13:34.830 --> 00:13:38.290
Or... When you join us.

00:13:39.510 --> 00:13:40.470
When she WHAT?!

00:13:40.540 --> 00:13:41.510
You want Lina...

00:13:41.570 --> 00:13:43.300
...to join you?

00:13:43.840 --> 00:13:45.830
For God's sake, don't do it!

00:13:48.150 --> 00:13:50.340
Why, you!!!

00:13:50.420 --> 00:13:55.510
The day you came to this
place, our master, Gaav...

00:13:55.590 --> 00:13:58.680
...the Demon Dragon King,
gave us orders to kill you.

00:13:58.760 --> 00:14:01.120
Gaav, the Demon Dragon King?!

00:14:01.190 --> 00:14:02.090
What?!

00:14:02.160 --> 00:14:03.290
That can't be!

00:14:03.360 --> 00:14:04.660
Who is he?

00:14:06.700 --> 00:14:09.860
You moron! Don't you
even know about THAT?!

00:14:09.940 --> 00:14:11.840
Should I know about it?

00:14:11.900 --> 00:14:13.870
Now, look...

00:14:13.940 --> 00:14:16.910
He's one of the five servants
of the Dark Lord Shabranigdo...

00:14:16.980 --> 00:14:19.500
...master of all
this world's Monsters.

00:14:19.580 --> 00:14:22.070
Gaav, the Demon Dragon King.

00:14:22.150 --> 00:14:25.280
Huh?! And someone
that important is after you?!

00:14:25.350 --> 00:14:28.010
You've gotta be kidding!
Why me?!

00:14:28.690 --> 00:14:32.750
In the beginning, we tried to
follow his orders and kill you.

00:14:32.830 --> 00:14:36.520
But we changed our minds a bit
when we saw that spell of yours.

00:14:36.600 --> 00:14:38.860
"That spell"?
The Ragna Blade?!

00:14:40.030 --> 00:14:44.160
We would become more powerful
if we could use such a spell.

00:14:48.770 --> 00:14:53.970
Sorry, guys, but I don't plan on
joining up with any Monsters!

00:14:54.410 --> 00:14:55.970
Good! Well said!

00:14:56.050 --> 00:14:59.880
That's right, Miss Lina!
Don't sell your soul to evil!

00:15:00.490 --> 00:15:03.980
I see... Well, how
about this in exchange?

00:15:07.960 --> 00:15:08.650
Phil!

00:15:08.730 --> 00:15:10.390
Daddy!

00:15:10.460 --> 00:15:12.450
That's why you kidnapped Phil?!

00:15:12.530 --> 00:15:14.470
You cowards!

00:15:14.530 --> 00:15:18.230
All we're after is more power.

00:15:19.270 --> 00:15:22.710
I see... So that's why
you're trying to take control...

00:15:22.780 --> 00:15:26.370
...of Atlas City's Sorcerers'
Guild and Seyruun's army?

00:15:26.450 --> 00:15:29.440
What are you guys really after?

00:15:29.750 --> 00:15:31.550
It seems I've said too much already.

00:15:31.620 --> 00:15:34.850
Now, then, Lina Inverse.
Will you swear allegiance to us?

00:15:34.920 --> 00:15:37.320
Or will you abandon this man?

00:15:38.590 --> 00:15:40.110
Miss Lina...

00:15:40.190 --> 00:15:46.150
What should I do?
I can't let Phil be killed, but...

00:15:47.100 --> 00:15:49.230
You haven't made up your mind.

00:15:49.300 --> 00:15:52.100
In that case, why don't I make
things a bit uncomfortable for him?

00:15:54.970 --> 00:15:56.970
Daddy!

00:15:58.810 --> 00:16:00.800
What?!

00:16:02.610 --> 00:16:04.840
Well, hello there!

00:16:05.280 --> 00:16:05.980
Xellos!

00:16:06.050 --> 00:16:07.080
Mr. Xellos!

00:16:07.150 --> 00:16:09.780
All right, nice move, pal!
Great timing!

00:16:10.560 --> 00:16:12.220
You!

00:16:12.290 --> 00:16:14.160
Now, this is no good.

00:16:14.230 --> 00:16:18.420
It's not very honorable for
Monsters to take hostages, is it?

00:16:19.500 --> 00:16:21.900
You should have more pride!

00:16:21.970 --> 00:16:23.990
Wha- What did you say?!

00:16:24.070 --> 00:16:27.330
Damn you!
What are you doing here?!

00:16:27.470 --> 00:16:28.840
That's a secret.

00:16:29.740 --> 00:16:32.840
Lina, I'll take
care of this man.

00:16:33.050 --> 00:16:35.880
The rest of you can feel
free to do what you want.

00:16:36.250 --> 00:16:37.310
All right!

00:16:37.380 --> 00:16:39.650
In that case, we don't
need to hold back!

00:16:39.720 --> 00:16:42.690
Right! All we have to do
is take these two out!

00:16:43.490 --> 00:16:44.650
Let's go!

00:16:44.720 --> 00:16:45.660
Right!

00:16:45.720 --> 00:16:47.890
Damu Bras!

00:16:54.470 --> 00:16:56.430
Wait!

00:17:11.750 --> 00:17:14.510
We can't let anyone stop us now
that we've come this far!

00:17:14.590 --> 00:17:18.040
You haven't forgotten the beating
we gave you before, have you?

00:17:18.120 --> 00:17:20.590
Besides, do you think you
can win by yourself...

00:17:20.660 --> 00:17:22.990
...while your power
is still sealed away?

00:17:35.010 --> 00:17:37.530
They've taken
their true forms!

00:17:38.280 --> 00:17:41.250
Don't assume we've been
showing you our true power!

00:17:41.310 --> 00:17:44.250
Now we know what
your game really is!

00:17:44.680 --> 00:17:47.170
Justice will triumph in the end!

00:17:47.820 --> 00:17:49.650
You're pathetic!

00:17:56.600 --> 00:17:59.590
Despite what we say,
taking on two Monsters...

00:17:59.670 --> 00:18:02.660
...can be pretty tricky.
First of all!

00:18:04.170 --> 00:18:07.260
Take 'em down one
at a time! GO!!!

00:18:10.640 --> 00:18:12.580
Nothing but talk...

00:18:13.910 --> 00:18:15.780
Lina, don't be stupid!

00:18:15.850 --> 00:18:18.440
I was just giving it a try...

00:18:18.520 --> 00:18:20.850
Elmekia Lance!

00:18:25.420 --> 00:18:26.550
Get lost!

00:18:26.630 --> 00:18:28.860
ASTRAL VINE!

00:18:34.370 --> 00:18:35.730
An enchanted sword?!

00:18:35.800 --> 00:18:39.070
I told you!
You haven't seen anything yet!

00:18:40.070 --> 00:18:42.300
Fascinating!

00:18:43.940 --> 00:18:46.670
FLARE ARROW!

00:18:55.750 --> 00:18:57.480
Get angrier!
Get more aggressive!

00:18:57.560 --> 00:19:02.150
Anger! Fear! Aggression! These
are the sources of a Monster's power!

00:19:03.900 --> 00:19:07.230
Even with the Sword
of Light, I can't beat her!

00:19:07.300 --> 00:19:11.500
And in my condition, I can't use
any of my really big spells!

00:19:15.610 --> 00:19:18.080
Those two have their
hands full over there.

00:19:18.140 --> 00:19:20.670
And there's the question
of how long we can last.

00:19:22.680 --> 00:19:24.210
Gourry!

00:19:24.280 --> 00:19:25.770
I... I'm okay!

00:19:30.320 --> 00:19:34.730
What's wrong? Can't you
be more amusing for me?

00:19:35.530 --> 00:19:37.930
In this case,
what have we got to lose?!

00:19:38.000 --> 00:19:39.930
Let's go, Gourry!

00:19:40.000 --> 00:19:41.230
Yeah!

00:19:41.300 --> 00:19:43.530
Fire... BALL!

00:19:48.240 --> 00:19:50.730
Gotta bet it all on one moment!

00:20:00.220 --> 00:20:01.450
You fool!

00:20:08.230 --> 00:20:11.220
What?!
That's not the Sword of Light!

00:20:11.730 --> 00:20:13.660
Fire...

00:20:18.940 --> 00:20:20.910
It... can't be...

00:20:21.370 --> 00:20:25.170
My powers may be sealed away, but
I can still use the Sword of Light!

00:20:32.920 --> 00:20:35.010
lm... Impossible!

00:20:35.090 --> 00:20:36.110
Miss Lina!

00:20:36.190 --> 00:20:37.050
Gourry!

00:20:37.120 --> 00:20:38.450
You did it, Lina!

00:20:39.830 --> 00:20:41.950
Even though we didn't set
it up between each other...

00:20:42.030 --> 00:20:44.660
...you still knew what
I had in mind, huh?

00:20:44.730 --> 00:20:46.700
I could guess what it was.

00:20:46.770 --> 00:20:49.760
After all, you and I have
been together for a while now.

00:20:49.840 --> 00:20:52.070
Connected, whether
we like it or not, huh?

00:20:52.140 --> 00:20:55.500
Okay, Kanzel.
We've beaten Mazenda.

00:20:55.570 --> 00:20:57.910
Now it's your turn!
